    },
    {
      "widths": [61, 120, 120, 180],
      "idea": "A moderate scrolling design between Q and the wider layouts. Slightly wider names, examples, and Behavior may reduce short lines while keeping the scroll distance much closer to Q than to T."
    },
    {
      "widths": [61, 135, 140, 220],
